# Copy to app/.env.local to turn on AI questions in your build (spec §8). Neither value is a secret:
# both are compiled into the app. Without them the app works as before, with no AI and no sign-in.
# Clerk dashboard → API keys → Publishable key.
EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# The cloud backend's address, no trailing slash.
EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_BACKEND_URL=
# Google sign-in (optional): the OAuth "Web application" client ID from Google Cloud, the same one
# entered in Clerk's Google settings. Without it the Google button is hidden; email codes still work.
EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=
